-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §38 תוספת השכר במגזר הציבורי: the teaching
-- employees are given the public sector's 2011 supplement, at the framework
-- agreement's rates and from its dates — 2.25% from 1.1.2011, completed to
-- 4%, 6.25% and 7.25% — on the combined salary and the 2001 and 2008
-- supplements; a separate component, in the base of the percentage
-- supplements on the combined salary save five, and of the hour value,
-- severance and the pension, training and Dafna funds; the 1987 and 1994
-- supplements grown at the same rates; the first rate paid from the August
-- 2011 salary. The framework agreement and its amendment of 11.4.2011 are
-- imported (2011-01-12_framework-agreement_public-sector_tosefet-2011,
-- 2011-04-11_framework-agreement_public-sector_amendment).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-16`
IMPORT `2011-01-12_framework-agreement_public-sector_tosefet-2011`
IMPORT `2011-04-11_framework-agreement_public-sector_amendment`

§ `38 תוספת השכר במגזר הציבורי`

DECLARE `Oz section 38 action` IS ONE OF
    `pay what section 38(א)(1) gives`

§§ `38(א)`

-- (א): the teaching employees (§4(א); part י speaks of all of them, on the
-- reform's terms or not) are entitled to the wage supplement agreed with
-- the New General Histadrut in the framework collective agreement of
-- 12.1.2011, as amended by the collective agreement of 11.4.2011, at the
-- rates and from the dates it set: 2.25% from 1.1.2011; from 1.1.2012
-- "השלמה ל – 4%", from 1.1.2013 to 6.25%, from 1.7.2013 to 7.25%. A
-- completion "to" a rate makes that rate the whole supplement from its day,
-- not an addition to the rate before. Each day is in the period it opens
-- (convention dates.start). The rates are this section's own. The
-- framework agreement (imported) covers no teaching employee — the teaching
-- scale is not in its annex א' — so §38 gives the teachers its supplement
-- itself. Each rate is the framework's allocation as amended on 11.4.2011
-- (both imported): (א)(1)'s 2.25% from 1.1.2011 is its §9.1's, (א)(2)'s 4%
-- from 1.1.2012 the amended §5.1.2's (the agreement as signed had 4.25%),
-- (א)(3)'s 6.25% from 1.1.2013 its §5.1.3's, and (א)(4)'s 7.25% from
-- 1.7.2013 the amendment's new §5.1.4's.
@ref akn:art_38__para_a akn:art_38__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_38__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_38__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_38__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_38__para_a/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 supplement rate under section 38 on` d IS
    BRANCH
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2013) THEN 7.25%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) THEN 6.25%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) THEN 4%
        IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011) THEN 2.25%
        OTHERWISE 0

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 38's rate is the framework agreement's as amended on` d IF
    `the 2011 supplement rate under section 38 on` d EQUALS `the 2011 framework allocation as amended on` d TRUE

§§ `38(ב)`

-- (ב): the 2011 supplement is computed on the combined salary, the 2001
-- supplement and the 2008 supplement.
@ref akn:art_38__para_b
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the combined salary` IS A NUMBER @desc the teaching employee's own, at his position
      `the 2001 supplement` IS A NUMBER
      `the 2008 supplement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 supplement under section 38` d `the combined salary` `the 2001 supplement` `the 2008 supplement` IS
    `the 2011 supplement rate under section 38 on` d TIMES (`the combined salary` PLUS `the 2001 supplement` PLUS `the 2008 supplement`)

§§ `38(ג)`

-- (ג): the 2011 supplement is paid as a separate salary component and is
-- brought into account for the percentage supplements computed on the
-- combined salary — save the 2001 supplement, the 2008 supplement, the Oz
-- LaTmura supplement, the 2011 erosion supplement and the promotion-grade
-- supplement — and for the hour value, severance pay under the Severance
-- Pay Law, and contributions to a pension provident fund, a training fund
-- and the Dafna fund. (Its own base is (ב)'s: it is not in it.)
@ref akn:art_38__para_c
`the 2011 supplement is a separate salary component` MEANS TRUE

GIVEN p IS A `what an Oz salary component counts for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2011 supplement under section 38 counts for` p IF
        NOT p EQUALS `computing supplement 2001`
    AND NOT p EQUALS `computing supplement 2008`
    AND NOT p EQUALS `computing the Oz LaTmura supplement`
    AND NOT p EQUALS `computing erosion supplement 2011`
    AND NOT p EQUALS `computing the promotion-grade supplement`
    AND NOT p EQUALS `computing supplement 2011`

§§ `38(ד)`

-- (ד): the 1987 and 1994 supplements paid to the teaching employees are
-- increased at the rates and from the dates of (א), "ביחס לערכם השיקלי
-- ערב חתימת הסכם זה": the increase is the day's rate of each one's shekel
-- value on the eve of the signing (13.8.2011; convention amounts.base),
-- added to what the supplement would be without it, as §16(ג)'s is.
@ref akn:art_38__para_d
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the supplement without the increase` IS A NUMBER @desc the 1987 or the 1994 supplement as it would be paid without (ד)
      `its value on the eve of the signing` IS A NUMBER @desc its shekel value on 13.8.2011
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1987 or 1994 supplement under section 38(ד)` d `the supplement without the increase` `its value on the eve of the signing` IS
    `the supplement without the increase` PLUS `the 2011 supplement rate under section 38 on` d TIMES `its value on the eve of the signing`

§§ `38(ה)`

-- (ה): what (א)(1) gives — the 2.25% from 1.1.2011, months before the
-- signing among them — is paid starting with the salary for August 2011,
-- and no later than the salary for September 2011 (convention
-- dates.salary-month: the salary month itself).
@ref akn:art_38__para_e
`section 38(א)(1) is paid from the salary of` MEANS `the Oz salary month` 2011 8
`section 38(א)(1) is paid at the latest with the salary of` MEANS `the Oz salary month` 2011 9

`paying section 38(א)(1)` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay what section 38(א)(1) gives`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "§38(ה): what (א)(1) gives is paid from the August 2011 salary and no later than the September 2011 salary"

GIVEN `the salary month it starts with` IS A NUMBER @desc `the Oz salary month` y m
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 38(א)(1) is paid in time` `the salary month it starts with` IF
        `the salary month it starts with` AT LEAST `section 38(א)(1) is paid from the salary of`
    AND `the salary month it starts with` AT MOST `section 38(א)(1) is paid at the latest with the salary of`

§§ `38 -- illustrations`

-- A combined salary of 10,000 with 2001 and 2008 supplements of 300 and
-- 200: 2.25% of 10,500 in 2011, 4% in 2012, 7.25% from July 2013.
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement under section 38` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2011) 10000 300 200 EQUALS 236.25
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement under section 38` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) 10000 300 200 EQUALS 420
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement under section 38` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2013) 10000 300 200 EQUALS 656.25
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement under section 38` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2013) 10000 300 200 EQUALS 761.25
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement under section 38` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2010) 10000 300 200 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement under section 38 counts for` `computing the hour value` AND `the 2011 supplement under section 38 counts for` `contributions to the Dafna fund`
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement under section 38 counts for` `computing another percentage supplement on the combined salary`
#ASSERT NOT `the 2011 supplement under section 38 counts for` `computing the Oz LaTmura supplement`
#ASSERT NOT `the 2011 supplement under section 38 counts for` `computing the promotion-grade supplement`
-- Of the seven percentage supplements the agreement tells apart, (ג) brings
-- the 2011 supplement into the base of one only: the rest, together.
#ASSERT count (filter (GIVEN p YIELD `computing a percentage supplement` p AND `the 2011 supplement under section 38 counts for` p) `what an Oz salary component may count for`) EQUALS 1
-- A 1994 supplement of 500 on the eve, 520 without the increase: 520 + 20
-- in 2012.
#ASSERT `the 1987 or 1994 supplement under section 38(ד)` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2012) 520 500 EQUALS 540
#ASSERT `section 38(א)(1) is paid in time` (`the Oz salary month` 2011 9)
#ASSERT NOT `section 38(א)(1) is paid in time` (`the Oz salary month` 2011 10)

-- Against the framework agreement of 12.1.2011 as amended on 11.4.2011:
-- every step is its, on every day — before 2011, in 2011, 2012 and 2013,
-- and from 1.7.2013. As signed, the framework's 1.1.2012 step was 4.25%
-- and it had none from 1.7.2013.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN d YIELD `section 38's rate is the framework agreement's as amended on` d)
            (LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2010, DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2011, DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2012, DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2013, DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2013)
#ASSERT NOT `the 2011 supplement rate under section 38 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2012) EQUALS `the 2011 framework allocation on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2012) TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the 2011 framework agreement covers` `a teaching employee of the State`

-- §§16(ב) and 38(ג) keep each other's supplement out of their bases, both
-- ways.
#ASSERT (NOT `the Oz LaTmura supplement counts for` `computing supplement 2011`) AND (NOT `the 2011 supplement under section 38 counts for` `computing the Oz LaTmura supplement`)
